     0.05,
     "Required new sweep extreme (ATR)",
     minval=0.0,
     step=0.01,
     group=GROUP_SWEEP,
     tooltip="After reset, a re-arm must extend beyond the previous sweep extreme by this amount.")

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// LTF CONFIRMATION
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
string structureModel = input.string(
     "Hybrid nearest",
     "Internal structure model",
     options=["Hybrid nearest", "Sweep candle", "Nearest confirmed pivot"],
