// 0 = IDLE
// 1 = ARMED, waiting internal MSS
// 2 = MSS, waiting displacement/filters/RR
// 3 = READY, waiting first retracement into origin
// 4 = RETRACED, waiting directional continuation confirmation
// 5 = CONTINUATION QUALIFIED, waiting post-continuation high/low break
// 6 = BREAK OCCURRED, waiting acceptance close/retest confirmation
